commit expand
  mountain/ashkar :: a Mountain
  mountain/ashkar . purpose = "volcanic peak towering above the old-growth basin"
  meadow/highpasture `locatedIn` mountain/ashkar
  smith/vesna `forgesFor` npc/delver
  culture/riverfolk `tradesWith` smith/vesna
  herd/riverkine `migratesTo` meadow/highpasture